    thinking: "**Initiating App Design**\n\nI\'m diving into this AI-powered file sorting application. The HTML file is my UI guide. The goal is a universal, cross-platform desktop experience, which means I\'m considering the core architecture and key interactions first. I\'ll need to define the underlying functionality.\n\n\n**Analyzing Architectural Requirements**\n\nI\'m carefully examining the architectural requirements. It seems I need to create a React app, potentially using Node/Express or Vite, for a desktop experience. This has to encompass local file management, database persistence (SQLite or JSON), and real (or mocked) Ollama API integration. I\'m focusing on how to best handle the Tauri/Rust desktop compilation within the web container environment. The available skills like `cloudsql-execute-sql` are on my radar.\n\n\n"
