nent, I\'m setting the search input, target folder cards, selected subfolder container, subfolder table rows, and the preview modal.\n\n\n**Defining View Element Styles**\n\nI\'m now detailing styles for the `RulesView.tsx`, the `ActivityView.tsx` and the `SettingsView.tsx` components. Specifically, I\'ve specified container and card details for the `RulesView.tsx` with a white/5 background, white/10 border, and subtle blur. For `ActivityView.tsx`, I\'ve finalized the header and button styles. Also, I have designed the filter chip for both active and inactive states, along with the appearance of the table and rows.\n\n\n"
